OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Frain at times this evening and into
OL,7,Fthe night, turning heavy at times.
OL,8,FBecoming drier later in the night from
OL,9,Fthe north and west with increasingly
OL,10,Fclear intervals developing.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FAny lingering rain in the
OL,13,Fsoutheast soon clearing. Then a day of
OL,14,Fsunny intervals and blustery showers,
OL,15,Fthese heavier and more frequent in the
OL,16,Fwest. Windy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
