OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FSunny
OL,6,Fspells and blustery heavy showers on
OL,7,FSaturday, the showers easing later.
OL,8,FMostly dry and bright Sunday, then
OL,9,Fcloudy with some rain on Monday.
